       (Wave B Part 8, 2026-04-28). Mirrors the existing `.video-background video`
       rule in home-v2-deferred.css (position: relative inside the flex parent) so
       the image doesn't depend on .video-background's positioning context — which
       only resolves to `position: absolute` once the deferred CSS loads. */
    .video-text__static-image {
